                    cm_insights:            `What this means`,
                    insight_lowcoord:       `Command coordination stayed low — two blind sites pulling apart. Without a shared intent and a sit-rep cadence, distributed authority became duplication rather than speed.`,
                    insight_lowtrust:       `Frontline trust stayed low: the message never gave a frightened night shift permission to act. A distributed model cannot function on staff who are waiting for instructions.`,
                    insight_bottleneck:     `You held decisions at a blind centre — the classic central-control reflex. Routine calls jammed at the executive cell while the wards waited, the single biggest failure against Spyridonidis' model.`,
                    insight_burned:         `You committed the entire £1.2M contingency. Pacing matters in a 48-hour event — a response that spends itself in the first hours has nothing left when night two arrives.`,
